---
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "@components/container.astro";
import Sectionhead from "@components/sectionhead.astro";

const lastUpdated = "25 September 2026";
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service">
  <Container>
    <Sectionhead>
      <Fragment slot="title">Terms of Service</Fragment>
      <Fragment slot="desc">Terms and Conditions</Fragment>
    </Sectionhead>
    
    <!-- Language Navigation -->
    <nav class="flex justify-center gap-4 mt-8" role="navigation" aria-label="Language selection">
      <span class="text-sm text-gray" title="Current language: ENG" aria-current="page">ENG</span>
      <a href="/de/tos" class="text-sm text-gray underline hover:text-gray-light transition-colors" title="Switch to German" aria-label="View terms in German">DEU</a>
      <a href="/bs/tos" class="text-sm text-gray underline hover:text-gray-light transition-colors" title="Switch to Bosnian" aria-label="View terms in Bosnian">BOS</a>
    </nav>
    
    <div class="flex w-full m-0 flex-col justify-evenly px-8">
      <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-3 mx-auto max-w-4xl mt-4">
        
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-2 text-gray-light">1. About Our Service</h2>
        <p class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light">
          Japodium is a mobile application and website that serves as an <strong>intermediary booking platform</strong> 
          connecting users with independent local tourist agencies, extreme sport operators, and tour guides who offer 
          recreational activities such as rafting tours, quad riding, bike rentals, guided city tours, and similar services.
        </p>
        <p class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light">
          Japodium is an independently run app, operated by its owners and based in Bosnia and Herzegovina. You can contact us 
          at <a class="underline" href="mailto:info@japodium.com">info@japodium.com</a>.
        </p>
        
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-2 text-gray-light">2. Important Disclaimer - We Are Not a Service Provider</h2>
        <p class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light">
          <strong>CRITICAL NOTICE:</strong> Japodium does NOT provide, operate, organise, or sell any recreational services, 
          tours, or activities. We act solely as a reservation platform that facilitates contact between users and 
          third-party service providers. All recreational activities, tours, pricing, content, and offers displayed 
          in our app are determined, operated, and provided exclusively by independent third-party agencies and operators.
        </p>
        <p class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light">
          Any contract for an activity is formed directly between you and the service provider, on that provider's own terms 
          and conditions. Japodium is not a party to that contract, does not act as agent for either party in concluding it, 
          and gives no warranty in relation to it.
        </p>
        
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-2 text-gray-light">3. Reservation Requests, Status and Confirmation</h2>
        <p class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light">
          What you submit through the app is a <strong>reservation request</strong>, not a completed booking. The process is 
          as follows:
        </p>
        <ul class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light ml-6 mt-2 list-disc">
          <li>Your request is recorded with the status <strong>"Pending"</strong>, and the details (name, email, phone, participants, date) are emailed to you and to our administrator at info@japodium.com</li>
          <li>Submitting a request does not create a binding booking, and it does not create any contract between you and Japodium</li>
          <li>Our administrator reviews the request and contacts you by email, Viber or WhatsApp to agree the details</li>
          <li>We put you in contact with the relevant third-party service provider or guide</li>
          <li>Once the details are agreed between you and the provider, our administrator marks the request as <strong>"Confirmed"</strong> in the app</li>
          <li><strong>"Confirmed"</strong> means the provider has agreed the details with you. Any resulting contract for the activity is between you and the provider, on the provider's terms</li>
          <li>From that point forward, all interactions, arrangements, and payments occur directly between you and the service provider</li>
          <li>Japodium is not involved in the actual service delivery, payment processing, or any aspect of your experience</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light">
          You can cancel a pending or confirmed reservation at any time in the app or by contacting us. 
          <strong>Japodium does not charge any cancellation fee.</strong> Once a reservation is confirmed, the provider's own 
          cancellation terms may apply, so please cancel as early as possible — ideally at least 48 hours before the planned 
          activity — so that we can inform the provider in time.
        </p>
        
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-2 text-gray-light">4. Prices, Payments and Packages</h2>
        <p class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light">
          <strong>We do not process payments.</strong> Japodium never asks for card details and does not collect, hold, or 
          transfer any money for activities. All payment is arranged and made directly between you and the service provider.
        </p>
        <p class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light">
          Prices shown in the app and in our emails are <strong>indicative figures supplied by the service provider for 
          information only</strong>. The final price, payment method, and any deposit or cancellation charge are set and 
          confirmed by the provider.
        </p>
        <p class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light">
          We facilitate reservation requests for <strong>individual activities only</strong>. We do not assemble, sell, or 
          offer packages or linked travel arrangements that combine an activity with accommodation, transport, or car rental, 
          and we do not act as a travel organiser or as a retailer of package travel.
        </p>
        
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-2 text-gray-light">5. Optional User Accounts</h2>
        <p class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light">
          You may optionally create a free account by signing in with your existing Google or Apple account. An account is not 
          required in order to submit reservation requests; you can always choose "Proceed as guest". An account simply lets 
          you pre-fill your contact details, view your reservation history and status, and cancel upcoming reservations.
        </p>
        <p class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light">
          You are responsible for the accuracy of the information in your account and for keeping access to your Google or 
          Apple account secure. You can edit your details or permanently delete your account at any time in the "Account" tab. 
          We may suspend or remove an account that is used for abusive, fraudulent, or unlawful purposes. How we handle account 
          data is explained in our <a class="underline" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>
        
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-2 text-gray-light">6. Eligibility</h2>
        <p class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light">
          The app is rated 4+ and can be downloaded and browsed by anyone. By submitting a reservation request or creating an 
          account, you confirm that you are legally able to enter into arrangements with a service provider, or that a parent or 
          guardian is doing so on your behalf.
        </p>
        <p class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light">
          Where a minor is to take part in an activity, a parent or guardian should submit the reservation request and agree the 
          arrangements, and the service provider must agree to that participation. Service providers may apply their own age, 
          health, or fitness requirements to any activity.
        </p>
        
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-2 text-gray-light">7. Extreme Sport Activities Warning</h2>
        <p class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light">
          <strong>RISK ACKNOWLEDGMENT:</strong> Many activities available through our platform may include extreme sports 
          or physically challenging activities that carry inherent risks of injury or death. These activities may not be 
          appropriate for all ages, fitness levels, or individuals with certain medical conditions. By using our reservation 
          service, you acknowledge that:
        </p>
        <ul class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light ml-6 mt-2 list-disc">
          <li>You participate in all activities at your own risk</li>
          <li>You are responsible for assessing your own fitness and suitability for any activity</li>
          <li>You should consult medical professionals if you have health concerns</li>
          <li>You will follow all safety instructions provided by the service providers</li>
          <li>Safety briefings, equipment, supervision, and insurance for the activity are the responsibility of the service provider, not Japodium</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-2 text-gray-light">8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light">
          Japodium provides only the intermediary platform described in these terms. To the fullest extent permitted by law, 
          Japodium, its owners, developers, and agents are not responsible for:
        </p>
        <ul class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light ml-6 mt-2 list-disc">
          <li>Any injuries, damages, losses, or accidents that may occur during any recreational activity provided by a third party</li>
          <li>The quality, safety, or condition of any services, equipment, or premises provided by third-party operators</li>
          <li>Inaccuracies in pricing, descriptions, or availability of offered services</li>
          <li>Cancellations, delays, or changes to scheduled activities</li>
          <li>The conduct, qualifications, insurance, or licensing status of third-party service providers</li>
          <li>Any disputes between users and service providers</li>
          <li>Payment issues, refund policies, or financial transactions with service providers</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light">
          <strong>Limits on these exclusions.</strong> Nothing in these terms excludes or limits our liability where it would 
          be unlawful to do so. In particular, we do not exclude or limit our liability for death or personal injury caused by 
          our own negligence, for fraud or fraudulent misrepresentation, or for any other liability that cannot lawfully be 
          excluded. If you are a consumer resident in the European Economic Area, these terms do not affect your mandatory 
          statutory rights, and nothing in them asks you to give up a protection you cannot lawfully give up. If any part of 
          this section is found unenforceable, the remaining parts continue to apply.
        </p>
        
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-2 text-gray-light">9. Service Provider Selection</h2>
        <p class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light">
          Service providers featured in the app are independent businesses that are solely responsible for their own 
          licensing, permits, insurance, safety standards, equipment, and staff. We do not audit, certify, supervise, or 
          guarantee any provider, and we make no representation as to their qualifications, licensing status, insurance 
          cover, or safety record. You are responsible for satisfying yourself that a provider and an activity are suitable 
          for you before taking part.
        </p>
        
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-2 text-gray-light">10. User Responsibilities</h2>
        <p class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light">
          As a user of our platform, you agree to:
        </p>
        <ul class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light ml-6 mt-2 list-disc">
          <li>Provide accurate information in all reservation requests</li>
          <li>Communicate directly with service providers regarding terms, conditions, and payments</li>
          <li>Read and understand the terms and conditions of each service provider</li>
          <li>Take full responsibility for your participation in any booked activities</li>
          <li>Not use the app or the reservation feature for abusive, fraudulent, or unlawful purposes</li>
          <li>Not submit reservation requests on behalf of another person without their knowledge and agreement</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-2 text-gray-light">11. App Usage Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light">
          This application is provided free of charge for informational and reservation facilitation purposes only. 
          Browsing the app requires no account; creating one is optional, as described in section 5. We reserve the right to 
          modify or discontinue the service at any time without notice. The app is provided "as is", and we do not guarantee 
          that it will always be available or error-free.
        </p>
        
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-2 text-gray-light">12. Governing Law and Dispute Resolution</h2>
        <p class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light">
          These terms are governed by the laws of Bosnia and Herzegovina, and the courts of Bosnia and Herzegovina have 
          jurisdiction. If you are a consumer resident in the European Economic Area, you keep the benefit of any mandatory 
          consumer protection rules of your country of residence, and you may also bring proceedings before the courts of 
          that country.
        </p>
        <p class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light">
          Any dispute concerning the activity itself — its price, quality, delivery, or cancellation — is between you and the 
          service provider and must be resolved directly with them. For complaints about the Japodium platform, contact us 
          first at <a class="underline" href="mailto:info@japodium.com">info@japodium.com</a> and we will try to resolve the 
          matter.
        </p>
        
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-2 text-gray-light">13. Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light">
          We may update these terms from time to time. The date below shows when they were last changed, and if we make a 
          significant change we will notify you in the app before it takes effect.
        </p>
        
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-2 text-gray-light">14. Contact Information</h2>
        <p class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light">
          For questions about these terms or our reservation facilitation service, contact us at:
          <a class="underline" href="mailto:info@japodium.com">info@japodium.com</a>
        </p>
        
        <p class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray-light mt-6">
          <strong>By using our app and reservation service, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to these terms.</strong>
        </p>
        <p class="text-md lg:text-left leading-relaxed text-slate-500 text-gray mt-4">
          Last updated: {lastUpdated}
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="w-full justify-self-end text-center mt-16 my-4">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="text-center text-sm text-gray underline hover:text-gray-light active:text-gray-light"
          >Homepage</a
        >
        <p class="text-center text-sm text-gray mt-2">
          <a href="/privacy" class="text-center text-sm text-gray underline hover:text-gray-light active:text-gray-light">Privacy</a>
        </p>
        <p class="text-center text-sm text-gray mt-2">
          <a href="/tos" class="text-center text-sm text-gray underline hover:text-gray-light active:text-gray-light">Terms of Service</a>
        </p>
        <p class="text-center text-sm text-gray mt-2">
          Copyright © {new Date().getFullYear()} Japodium. All rights reserved.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</Layout>
